_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCbzL-eneB3UtoiXmVa29Lt8Zdm_f7BFBEWh3b_Y3AX1Q&oe=6A4A5790"}, {"file_name": "7.png", "id": "1716979942504180", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307505_1716979945837513_570933829934417706_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=u0kemdYLv4QQ7kNvwEjfagw&_nc_oc=AdrYCBMs9C43DNCOmzrcZHU-xoXKa_X8zHyuE53cmzn5qQeY80J4KI9N5doIestgf3E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDFX7cl3HFbkI9vRH63a4F5tyPFQPj0N32gJDUwzVIQ8w&oe=6A4A536B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Cistercian VR", "keywords": ["cistercian", "history", "education", "simulator", "monk"], "long_description": "**Learn about the world of Cistercian monks** and experience their silent way of life through immersive VR. \nTravel between the Medieval and Gothic periods and explore recreated dining halls and kitchens that reflect the spirit and discipline of monastic living.\n\n**Explore four distinct spaces**\n\n- Medieval Dining Hall\n- Medieval Kitchen\n- Gothic Dining Hall\n- Gothic Kitchen\n\nMove through each space and uncover how architecture environment and tradition evolved over time.\n\n**Experience monastic life first hand**\n\n- Communicate using symbolic hand gestures\n- Follow instructions in silence\n- Prepare and cook food as it was done centuries ago\n- Discover daily routines shaped by simplicity and quiet rhythm\n\nStep into a calm and thoughtful journey where history becomes something you live rather than observe.", "short_description": "Step into the silent world of Cistercian monks in a VR experience that brings Medieval and Gothic life to you. Learn hand signs to communicate without words and explore monastic routines through immersive dining and cooking."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://strandforge.com/documents/Privacy-Policy_Cistercian_VR.pdf", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publish